        "text": "PR #313, merged Mon, will report zero coverage on first weekly run because 0 of 179 first-party SKILL.md files declare `capabilities:` frontmatter. Author proposes Phase 1 PR annotating ~16 high-blast-radius skills (`liquidpad-launch` first — onchain writes, spends money), with a smaller alternative of adding an \"undeclared: N skills\" row to capabilities-map itself.",
